{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":10372044,"ns":0,"title":"Stutzerimonas chloritidismutans","revisions":[{"revid":1371041332,"parentid":1369785601,"minor":true,"timestamp":"2026-08-24T06:37:32Z","size":3369,"sha1":"0efe0bcbeafcb411f7085e73f099e1ad5b6325cb","slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","content":"{{Short description|Species of bacterium}}\n{{Speciesbox\n| genus = Stutzerimonas\n| species = chloritidismutans\n| authority = (Wolterink ''et al.'' 2002) Lalucat ''et al.'' 2022<ref name=\"LPSN\">{{cite web\n |title=Species: Stutzerimonas chloritidismutans\n |url=https://lpsn.dsmz.de/species/stutzerimonas-chloritidismutans\n |website=[[List of Prokaryotic names with Standing in Nomenclature]]\n |publisher=[[Leibniz Institute DSMZ]]\n |access-date=16 August 2026\n}}</ref>\n| synonyms =\n* ''Pseudomonas chloritidismutans'' <small>Wolterink ''et al.'' 2002</small>\n* ''Pseudomonas kunmingensis'' <small>Xie ''et al.'' 2014</small>\n* ''Stutzerimonas kunmingensis'' <small>(Xie ''et al.'' 2014) Lalucat ''et al.'' 2022</small>\n}}\n\n'''''Stutzerimonas chloritidismutans''''' is a [[Gram-negative bacteria|Gram-negative]], rod-shaped, [[facultative anaerobic organism|facultatively anaerobic]] bacterium in the family [[Pseudomonadaceae]]. It performs dissimilatory [[chlorate]] reduction but does not carry out [[denitrification]].<ref name=\"Wolterink2002\">{{cite journal\n |last1=Wolterink\n |first1=A. F. W. M.\n |last2=Jonker\n |first2=A. B.\n |last3=Kengen\n |first3=S. W. M.\n |last4=Stams\n |first4=A. J. M.\n |title=''Pseudomonas chloritidismutans'' sp. nov., a non-denitrifying, chlorate-reducing bacterium\n |journal=International Journal of Systematic and Evolutionary Microbiology\n |year=2002\n |volume=52\n |issue=6\n |pages=2183–2190\n |doi=10.1099/00207713-52-6-2183\n |pmid=12508887\n |doi-access=free\n}}</ref>\n\nThe type strain, AW-1, was isolated from biomass in an anaerobic chlorate-reducing [[bioreactor]].<ref name=\"Wolterink2002\" /> \n\n==Taxonomy==\nThe species was originally classified as ''Pseudomonas chloritidismutans''. It was transferred to the genus ''[[Stutzerimonas]]'' when the ''Pseudomonas stutzeri'' group was separated from ''[[Pseudomonas]]''.<ref name=\"Lalucat2022\">{{cite journal\n |last1=Lalucat\n |first1=Jorge\n |last2=Gomila\n |first2=Margarita\n |last3=Mulet\n |first3=Magdalena\n |last4=Zaruma\n |first4=Alexander\n |last5=García-Valdés\n |first5=Elena\n |title=Past, present and future of the boundaries of the ''Pseudomonas'' genus: proposal of ''Stutzerimonas'' gen. nov.\n |journal=Systematic and Applied Microbiology\n |year=2022\n |volume=45\n |issue=1\n |article-number=126289\n |doi=10.1016/j.syapm.2021.126289\n |pmid=34920232\n}}</ref>\n\nGenome-based analysis supported the distinction between ''S. chloritidismutans'' and ''[[Stutzerimonas stutzeri|S. stutzeri]]''. The same analysis found that ''Stutzerimonas kunmingensis'' belongs to the same genomic species and treated it as a later heterotypic synonym of ''S. chloritidismutans''.<ref name=\"Gomila2022\">{{cite journal\n |last1=Gomila\n |first1=Margarita\n |last2=Mulet\n |first2=Magdalena\n |last3=García-Valdés\n |first3=Elena\n |last4=Lalucat\n |first4=Jorge\n |title=Genome-based taxonomy of the genus ''Stutzerimonas'' and proposal of ''S. frequens'' sp. nov. and ''S. degradans'' sp. nov. and emended descriptions of ''S. perfectomarina'' and ''S. chloritidismutans''\n |journal=Microorganisms\n |year=2022\n |volume=10\n |issue=7\n |article-number=1363\n |doi=10.3390/microorganisms10071363\n |pmid=35889082\n |doi-access=free\n|pmc=9320692\n }}</ref>\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Taxonbar|from=Q62904786}}\n\n[[Category:Gram-negative bacteria]]\n[[Category:Bacteria described in 2002]]\n\n{{Gammaproteobacteria-stub}}"}}}],"contentmodel":"wikitext","pagelanguage":"en","pagelanguagehtmlcode":"en","pagelanguagedir":"ltr","touched":"2026-10-30T04:30:36Z","lastrevid":1371041332,"length":3369}]}}